  "name": "Despoiled Ground's ticks do not create more Despoiled Ground (#13077)",
  "contract": [
    "Presence of Y'Shaarj 803035 (Cultist) tooltips: giving damage dealt a $h% (20%) chance to curse the ground",
    "for $807632d. aura_ascension_cultist_event implements the curse as Despoiled Ground 805180, a persistent",
    "area aura that deals Shadow damage every 3 sec. Its proc check accepted any damage the Cultist dealt except",
    "Thoughtseize, so each Despoiled Ground tick rolled to curse more ground and the patches fed themselves;",
    "#13077 reports that it procs off itself. Expected (ruled by the PR author from Ascension experience):",
    "Despoiled Ground's own ticks never create another patch. One patch is cast directly over twelve stationary",
    "enemies with Presence of Y'Shaarj active and no other damage source, so in 11 sec its ticks give about 36",
    "rolls at 20%, and before the fix a second patch was near certain (0.8^36 is about 0.03%). Exactly one",
    "Despoiled Ground may have been cast (spell_cast_count counts triggered casts too; the dynamic_object metric",
    "only reports whether one exists)."
  ],
